### Proportions

If rainfall is over 10mm then that day is considered a flood risk, we can convert our data to capture this

```{r data manipulation}
flood_1990 <- rainfall_1990>10
flood_2012 <- rainfall_2012>10
```

These vectors comprise of TRUE and FALSE corresponding to if the day is a flood risk day. The total flood risks in 2012 can be calculated by `sum(flood_2012)`.


